# the push-stream captures the tuxweb tests are built on; no key material,
# no addresses, and without them a clean checkout cannot run its own tests
!tuxweb/tests/fixtures/*.bin

# pubscan's author-specific patterns. Untracked ON PURPOSE: a published
# scanner that carries the literal it hunts for has already disclosed it.
# ci/pubscan.local.example documents the format and IS tracked.
ci/pubscan.local

# Agent orientation docs stay out of the published repo (Lewis, 2026-09-07):
# a file telling the next model how to behave in here is self-attribution
# wearing a process document's clothes. Keep them locally if they help; they
# do not ship. The engineering rules CONTRIBUTING.md carried - the qemu-user
# boot rule and the [CONFIRMED] discipline - moved into docs/TRAPS.md, which
# is where they belonged anyway.
CLAUDE.md
CONTRIBUTING.md
AGENTS.md
.cursorrules
